*** Settings ***
Resource    ../../../pom/<<resource-group>>/<<operation>>/<<operation>>_pom.resource
Resource    ../../common/schema_validation_flow.resource
Resource    ../../../resource/config/schema/schema.resource
Resource    ../../../resource/config/driven/data_driven.resource
